OL,3,ACalifornia police investigate after 27
OL,4,Afall ill at half-marathon running event
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in Santa Barbara, California,
OL,7,Fare investigating after nearly 30
OL,8,Fpeople had to seek medical care at a
OL,9,Fhalf-marathon running event held in the
OL,10,Fcity on Sunday.
OL,12,FIn a statement provided to the BBC's US
OL,13,Fpartner CBS News, officers said they
OL,14,Freceived a report from Santa Barbara
OL,15,FCottage Hospital about race
OL,16,Fparticipants who sought medical
OL,17,Ftreatment "for unusual symptoms" after
OL,18,Fthe race ended.
OL,20,F"The cause of the reported symptoms has
OL,21,Fnot been confirmed," the statement
OL,22,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
