OL,3,ACalifornia police investigate after 27
OL,4,Afall ill at half-marathon running event
OL,5,
OL,6,FCottage Health, which operates the
OL,7,Fhospital, told CBS it had seen "a
OL,8,Flarger than expected number of
OL,9,Femergency visits" from those who ran
OL,10,Fthe race.
